    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 1005 PM CDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line extending from near Latham to 6 miles east of Burden to 5 miles southeast of Dexter, moving east at 30 mph. HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees. Locations impacted include... Cedar Vale, Burden, Moline, Dexter, Grenola, Atlanta, Latham, Elk Falls, and Cambridge.",
